{"unit_id":"fhy-action__dsh-cursor-halo#card-zh","repo":"fhy-action/dsh-cursor-halo","commit":"2a8ccdd25f0b46b2525ddceff45585776140e7ff","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Cursor Halo 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的光标视觉插件。它在 shell.overlay 中挂载全屏透明层，跟随鼠标显示 DeepSeek 蓝色圆点、呼吸光晕和 Canvas 连续拖尾，并在左键点击时让光晕收束回弹。用户可在设置页调整光晕尺寸与周期、拖尾时长、圆点显示方式及弹层隐藏行为；设置即时生效并保存在浏览器本地。适合希望为 DSH 网页界面增加可定制光标反馈的用户，不需要 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1355-1364","client.js:911-975","client.js:1126-1287"]}
{"unit_id":"fhy-action__dsh-cursor-halo#card-en","repo":"fhy-action/dsh-cursor-halo","commit":"2a8ccdd25f0b46b2525ddceff45585776140e7ff","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DeepSeek Cursor Halo adds a blue dot, breathing halo, and smooth Canvas trail to DSH Web. Its settings control halo size and speed, trail duration, dot visibility, and behavior over overlays. Changes apply immediately and persist in browser storage. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1355-1364","client.js:911-975","client.js:1126-1287"]}
