{"unit_id":"fhy-action__dsh-cursor-halo#feature-1","repo":"fhy-action/dsh-cursor-halo","commit":"2a8ccdd25f0b46b2525ddceff45585776140e7ff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Cursor Halo 的功能「指针蓝点与光晕」：鼠标移动时以蓝色圆点和径向渐隐光晕替代系统指针；可单独关闭光晕或圆点，并调整光晕尺寸与呼吸周期。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:788-811","client.js:911-945"]}
{"unit_id":"fhy-action__dsh-cursor-halo#feature-2","repo":"fhy-action/dsh-cursor-halo","commit":"2a8ccdd25f0b46b2525ddceff45585776140e7ff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Cursor Halo 的功能「连续鼠标拖尾」：沿指针近期轨迹绘制平滑渐变 Canvas 尾线；可关闭拖尾或设置保留轨迹时长。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:813-909","client.js:1245-1277"]}
{"unit_id":"fhy-action__dsh-cursor-halo#feature-3","repo":"fhy-action/dsh-cursor-halo","commit":"2a8ccdd25f0b46b2525ddceff45585776140e7ff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Cursor Halo 的功能「弹层隐藏与点击反馈」：默认在菜单、下拉列表、对话框和设置区域上隐藏效果并恢复系统指针；左键点击时光晕收束后回弹。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:720-786","client.js:947-975"]}
